  "changes": [
    "Read small LBV2 images using pinned adjacent frames of the original 32-KiB resident page cache; paged fallback for larger images, OOM/busy and F401",
    "Use a catalog-only lookup for VM files; reading a compiled image does not rebuild or write the USB/FAT scratch index",
    "Reuse the existing verifier union as a small-image boundary bitmap and create IndexB/Boundaries directories only when needed",
    "Use direct raw/cache operand reads and bounded borrow lifetimes; retain copied operands for trace callbacks and mutable alias semantics",
    "Reduce repeated fetch/dispatch work; preserve narrow/wide formats, bounds, exact errors, INPUT/resume and the original logical instruction count",
    "Extend checked integer spans to control flow and constants while preserving tag/overflow checks and 32-instruction polling",
    "Keep bit-exact Value boxing using 32-bit limbs; signed zero, NaN payloads and int32 wire tags unchanged",
    "Add read-only loan counters and offline HIL guards; diagnostic-only timing remains separate from shipping comparisons"
